{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0188G4cxtHP5gKTh9ePyJUr4","type":"tool_result","content":"80:- 1000 17d. Perception; E.Suspicion: suspicion\n424:- `r.marker(x, y, z = 0, o = {})`: an objective marker over a world point: a bobbing diamond (and its label) while it is on screen, an arrow at the screen's edge pointing to it while it is off (offscreen: false hides it then). o: { label, color: '#ffd040', offscreen: 'arrow' }\n431:- `r.sightCone(obs, o = {})` †: an observer's view on the ground: a dithered fan fov wide (radians) about its facing, out to range, cut short where the map hides a body's chest (map.ray, the height rules), draped over the ground below. o: { range: 120, fov: 1.6, facing, map, eye, color: '#ffe080', alpha: .3, rays }. Call it in draw (it is a decal: under walls and bodies)\n1002:- `new E.Suspicion(o = {}) → suspicion`: new E.Suspicion({ rise, decay, notice, search, alert, forget }): a guard's mind (its fields, below, are its options). Its level rises while it sees the target (faster the more exposed and nearer), decays while it doesn't, and names a state: 'calm', 'notice' (turn and look), 'search' (go to last), 'alert' (chase). An alert guard that loses the target searches for forget seconds. Each step: suspicion.update(dt, seen, target)\n1003:- `suspicion.hear(strength, at)` †: a noise heard (strength 0..1, from E.hears) at a point: at least noticed, never more than searching\n1005:- `suspicion.update(dt, seen, target)` †: one step: seen is E.sees' result (or true / false), target the body seen. Returns the state\n1014:- `E.hears(lis, noise, map)`: how loud a noise ({ x, y, z, loud: its radius in world units, 80 }) is where listener stands: 1 at the noise, 0 at its radius and beyond, halved when a top of map stands between them (a wall muffles it)\n1015:- `E.sees(obs, tgt, o = {})`: can observer see target? { seen, d (ground distance), angle (observer -> target), exposure: 0..1 }. The target must be within range and inside the cone fov wide (radians) about the observer's facing; exposure is the share of three points on it (its feet, its chest, its head) that the observer's eyes see past every top of o.map, times the target's own exposure (default 1) and .6 when it crouches (it also shows lower). o: { range: 120, fov: 1.6, facing, map, eye }\n427:- `r.prop(name, x, y, z, o = {})` †: set dressing from E.prop: r.prop('torch', x, y, z, { size, color, flip, light: true, halo: true, bias, hides, footprint }) feet on the world point; flames animate and glow. light: true also adds a warm light to game.lights. A prop at least chest high (E.HEIGHTS.chest, 22: a pillar, a statue, a lamp) drawn in front of an x-ray actor shows the actor's silhouette through it; a lower one (grass, a crate, a barrel) doesn't; hides: true or false says so.\n430:- `r.shape(id, x, y, z = 0, o = {})` †: Queue a shape standing at (x, y, z), feet on the point, depth sorted like an actor: r.shape(id | entry, x, y, z, o). o: { facing (radians, where its front points; default PI/2, south, as written), scale, mats: { slot: material }, flip (mirror it x to -x before facing), params (a generator's: { h: 30 }), bias, hides (x-ray silhouettes show through it: by default when it stands at least E.HEIGHTS.chest, 22, high), footprint, light (add its lights to game.lights), shadow (default true), charView (default true: steep views draw it from the characters' lower angle), flash, alpha, xray, pick (r.pick finds it) }\n105:- 1675 Module strategy: real-time strategy and simulation: selection, orders, armies, production, resources, placement, fog, AI; a day clock, needs, overlays (engine/modules/strategy.js); E.Clock: clock, E.Strategy: strategy\n372:- `game.lights.ambient = .15` †: how lit unlit places are, 0 (black) .. 1\n475:- `game.enableGPU(o = {})` †: turn on WebGPU lighting: where it can't draw (no WebGPU, a side view) the canvas lighting stands in, with its own ambient (game.lights.ambient) and the same lights. opts: { map, bands, ambient, fallback, ... }\n613:- `E.WEATHER: rain, snow, ash, leaves, sand` †: the kinds of weather: n drops at amount 1, fall speed (world units a second), colors, streak (seconds of motion a drop's line shows), sway, rest (seconds it lies where it lands), splash, wind (how hard the wind pushes it), size, big (the share a pixel bigger). Add your own: E.WEATHER.embers = { ... }\n1677:- `new E.Clock(o = {}) → clock` †: new E.Clock({ day: 240 (real seconds of game time a day), hour: 8 (to start at) })\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181319__xb81546/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f3c3e9b-9eb4-44c2-94b1-164e7be1aa93","uuid":"ba7e770b-da30-4f39-a6d7-47d6cdea00a4","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:17:33.013Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"80:- 1000 17d. Perception; E.Suspicion: suspicion\n424:- `r.marker(x, y, z = 0, o = {})`: an objective marker over a world point: a bobbing diamond (and its label) while it is on screen, an arrow at the screen's edge pointing to it while it is off (offscreen: false hides it then). o: { label, color: '#ffd040', offscreen: 'arrow' }\n431:- `r.sightCone(obs, o = {})` †: an observer's view on the ground: a dithered fan fov wide (radians) about its facing, out to range, cut short where the map hides a body's chest (map.ray, the height rules), draped over the ground below. o: { range: 120, fov: 1.6, facing, map, eye, color: '#ffe080', alpha: .3, rays }. Call it in draw (it is a decal: under walls and bodies)\n1002:- `new E.Suspicion(o = {}) → suspicion`: new E.Suspicion({ rise, decay, notice, search, alert, forget }): a guard's mind (its fields, below, are its options). Its level rises while it sees the target (faster the more exposed and nearer), decays while it doesn't, and names a state: 'calm', 'notice' (turn and look), 'search' (go to last), 'alert' (chase). An alert guard that loses the target searches for forget seconds. Each step: suspicion.update(dt, seen, target)\n1003:- `suspicion.hear(strength, at)` †: a noise heard (strength 0..1, from E.hears) at a point: at least noticed, never more than searching\n1005:- `suspicion.update(dt, seen, target)` †: one step: seen is E.sees' result (or true / false), target the body seen. Returns the state\n1014:- `E.hears(lis, noise, map)`: how loud a noise ({ x, y, z, loud: its radius in world units, 80 }) is where listener stands: 1 at the noise, 0 at its radius and beyond, halved when a top of map stands between them (a wall muffles it)\n1015:- `E.sees(obs, tgt, o = {})`: can observer see target? { seen, d (ground distance), angle (observer -> target), exposure: 0..1 }. The target must be within range and inside the cone fov wide (radians) about the observer's facing; exposure is the share of three points on it (its feet, its chest, its head) that the observer's eyes see past every top of o.map, times the target's own exposure (default 1) and .6 when it crouches (it also shows lower). o: { range: 120, fov: 1.6, facing, map, eye }\n427:- `r.prop(name, x, y, z, o = {})` †: set dressing from E.prop: r.prop('torch', x, y, z, { size, color, flip, light: true, halo: true, bias, hides, footprint }) feet on the world point; flames animate and glow. light: true also adds a warm light to game.lights. A prop at least chest high (E.HEIGHTS.chest, 22: a pillar, a statue, a lamp) drawn in front of an x-ray actor shows the actor's silhouette through it; a lower one (grass, a crate, a barrel) doesn't; hides: true or false says so.\n430:- `r.shape(id, x, y, z = 0, o = {})` †: Queue a shape standing at (x, y, z), feet on the point, depth sorted like an actor: r.shape(id | entry, x, y, z, o). o: { facing (radians, where its front points; default PI/2, south, as written), scale, mats: { slot: material }, flip (mirror it x to -x before facing), params (a generator's: { h: 30 }), bias, hides (x-ray silhouettes show through it: by default when it stands at least E.HEIGHTS.chest, 22, high), footprint, light (add its lights to game.lights), shadow (default true), charView (default true: steep views draw it from the characters' lower angle), flash, alpha, xray, pick (r.pick finds it) }\n105:- 1675 Module strategy: real-time strategy and simulation: selection, orders, armies, production, resources, placement, fog, AI; a day clock, needs, overlays (engine/modules/strategy.js); E.Clock: clock, E.Strategy: strategy\n372:- `game.lights.ambient = .15` †: how lit unlit places are, 0 (black) .. 1\n475:- `game.enableGPU(o = {})` †: turn on WebGPU lighting: where it can't draw (no WebGPU, a side view) the canvas lighting stands in, with its own ambient (game.lights.ambient) and the same lights. opts: { map, bands, ambient, fallback, ... }\n613:- `E.WEATHER: rain, snow, ash, leaves, sand` †: the kinds of weather: n drops at amount 1, fall speed (world units a second), colors, streak (seconds of motion a drop's line shows), sway, rest (seconds it lies where it lands), splash, wind (how hard the wind pushes it), size, big (the share a pixel bigger). Add your own: E.WEATHER.embers = { ... }\n1677:- `new E.Clock(o = {}) → clock` †: new E.Clock({ day: 240 (real seconds of game time a day), hour: 8 (to start at) })","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181319__xb81546/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181307__x22cc1b/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":137,"oldLines":3,"newStart":137,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":2050,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"df8c1585-be07-48c4-a448-ca4232e59bdf\",\"uuid\":\"4a261422-e190-4498-9698-83c03c984141\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":2150,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"df8c1585-be07-48c4-