{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgf87aGU2ZMqTMB2Mcq5S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WtQDDekdE6MPuJro4ES3Hm","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /tmp/bb-xb81546/dl/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff && sed -n 995,1013p API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-500; grep -n \"^- \\`new E.Bullets\\|^- \\`shots\\.\\|^- \\`new E.Attack\\|^- \\`attack\\.\\|^- \\`new E.Combo\\|^- \\`combo\\.\" API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-300","description":"Read Suspicion, Bullets and Attack API lines"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3630,"cache_read_input_tokens":172447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3630,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f3c3e9b-9eb4-44c2-94b1-164e7be1aa93","uuid":"908773bd-2dc9-4da7-844e-dac154513aae","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:26:31.234Z","request_id":"req_011Cgf87ZpgVuzvWmSPJtP6p","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01WtQDDekdE6MPuJro4ES3Hm":{"command":"cd /tmp/bb-xb81546/dl/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff && sed -n 995,1013p API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-500; grep -n \"^- \\`new E.Bullets\\|^- \\`shots\\.\\|^- \\`new E.Attack\\|^- \\`attack\\.\\|^- \\`new E.Combo\\|^- \\`combo\\.\" API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-300","description":"Read Suspicion, Bullets and Attack API lines"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WtQDDekdE6MPuJro4ES3Hm","type":"tool_result","content":"- `mover.tire` †: { climb, climbJump, glide, sprint } it costs\n- `mover.turn = 14` †: how fast it turns, radians a second\n- `mover.vault = 14` †: walls up to this high are vaulted at a run\n- `mover.wall = null` †: the face it holds on to (map.wall's), or null\n\n## 17d. Perception\n\n- `new E.Suspicion(o = {}) → suspicion`: new E.Suspicion({ rise, decay, notice, search, alert, forget }): a guard's mind (its fields, below, are its options). Its level rises while it sees the target (faster the more exposed and nearer), decays while it doesn't, and names a state: 'calm', 'notice' (turn and look), 'search' (go to last), 'alert' (chase). An alert guard that loses the target searches for forget seconds. Each step: suspicion.update(dt, seen, target)\n- `suspicion.hear(strength, at)` †: a noise heard (strength 0..1, from E.hears) at a point: at least noticed, never more than searching\n- `suspicion.reset()` †: back to calm\n- `suspicion.update(dt, seen, target)` †: one step: seen is E.sees' result (or true / false), target the body seen. Returns the state\n- `suspicion.alert = 1`, `suspicion.notice = .3`, `suspicion.search = .65` †: the levels where each state starts\n- `suspicion.changed = false` †: the state changed this step\n- `suspicion.decay = .3`, `suspicion.rise = 1.5` †: per second\n- `suspicion.forget = 6` †: seconds an alert guard searches after losing the target\n- `suspicion.last = null` †: where it last saw or heard the target ({ x, y, z }), or null\n- `suspicion.level = 0` †: 0..1.2, how suspicious\n- `suspicion.since = 0` †: seconds since it last saw or heard anything\n- `suspicion.state = 'calm'` †: 'calm' | 'notice' | 'search' | 'alert'\n640:- `new E.Attack(spec = {}, over) → slash`: new E.Attack(spec) or new E.Attack('slash', { reach: 9 }): a name from E.MOVES plus overrides\n653:- `new E.Combo(specs, o = {}) → combo`: new E.Combo(items, { window: .3 }): items are move names, specs or Attacks\n654:- `combo.active`: true while the current hit can connect\n655:- `combo.busy`: true while a hit of the chain is swinging\n656:- `combo.cancel()`: stop the chain; the next press starts it over\n657:- `combo.current`: the Attack of the current hit\n658:- `combo.hits(targets, test, fn)`: the current hit's hits(targets, test, fn): fn(target) once per swing where test(target) is true\n659:- `combo.press()`: start or continue the chain. Returns true if a hit started\n660:- `combo.state`: what Humanoid.update wants as `attack` (null when idle)\n661:- `combo.update(dt)`: advance the current hit; returns the phase that began, as Attack.update\n662:- `combo.idle = 99`: seconds since the last hit ended\n663:- `combo.moves`: the Attacks\n664:- `combo.step = -1`: the index of the current hit (-1 before the first)\n665:- `combo.window`: seconds after a hit ends that a press still chains\n1019:- `new E.Bullets(game, o = {}) → shots`: new E.Bullets(game, { plane: 'ground' | 'side', max: 800, sparks: true }); game: its game\n1020:- `shots.burst(base, vels)`: fire several at once from a pattern list of [vx, v2] (v2 = vy on the ground plane, vz in side view)\n1021:- `shots.clear(team)`: remove every bullet, or only one team's\n1022:- `shots.draw(r)`: queue them for drawing (glowing cores, or their sprites)\n1023:- `shots.fire(b)`: fire one bullet. Fields: x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, r, dmg, life, team, color, core, sprite, pierce, grav, data\n1024:- `shots.hit(targets, fn, team)`: test bullets of `team` against targets (objects with x, y, z and r, or w/h in side view). fn(bullet, target). Returns hits\n1025:- `shots.update(dt, map)`: move them one step; with a map they stop at walls (a TileMap, or a PlatformMap in side views)\n1026:- `shots.list = []`: the live bullets\n1027:- `shots.max`: at most this many at once\n1028:- `shots.plane`: 'ground' (they fly over x and y) or 'side' (x and z)\n1029:- `shots.sparks`: a puff of sparks where one hits a wall\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181319__xb81546/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f3c3e9b-9eb4-44c2-94b1-164e7be1aa93","uuid":"1046e484-bec7-4878-9342-6d42ef231289","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:26:31.424Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"- `mover.tire` †: { climb, climbJump, glide, sprint } it costs\n- `mover.turn = 14` †: how fast it turns, radians a second\n- `mover.vault = 14` †: walls up to this high are vaulted at a run\n- `mover.wall = null` †: the face it holds on to (map.wall's), or null\n\n## 17d. Perception\n\n- `new E.Suspicion(o = {}) → suspicion`: new E.Suspicion({ rise, decay, notice, search, alert, forget }): a guard's mind (its fields, below, are its options). Its level rises while it sees the target (faster the more exposed and nearer), decays while it doesn't, and names a state: 'calm', 'notice' (turn and look), 'search' (go to last), 'alert' (chase). An alert guard that loses the target searches for forget seconds. Each step: suspicion.update(dt, seen, target)\n- `suspicion.hear(strength, at)` †: a noise heard (strength 0..1, from E.hears) at a point: at least noticed, never more than searching\n- `suspicion.reset()` †: back to calm\n- `suspicion.update(dt, seen, target)` †: one step: seen is E.sees' result (or true / false), target the body seen. Returns the state\n- `suspicion.alert = 1`, `suspicion.notice = .3`, `suspicion.search = .65` †: the levels where each state starts\n- `suspicion.changed = false` †: the state changed this step\n- `suspicion.decay = .3`, `suspicion.rise = 1.5` †: per second\n- `suspicion.forget = 6` †: seconds an alert guard searches after losing the target\n- `suspicion.last = null` †: where it last saw or heard the target ({ x, y, z }), or null\n- `suspicion.level = 0` †: 0..1.2, how suspicious\n- `suspicion.since = 0` †: seconds since it last saw or heard anything\n- `suspicion.state = 'calm'` †: 'calm' | 'notice' | 'search' | 'alert'\n640:- `new E.Attack(spec = {}, over) → slash`: new E.Attack(spec) or new E.Attack('slash', { reach: 9 }): a name from E.MOVES plus overrides\n653:- `new E.Combo(specs, o = {}) → combo`: new E.Combo(items, { window: .3 }): items are move names, specs or Attacks\n654:- `combo.active`: true while the current hit can connect\n655:- `combo.busy`: true while a hit of the chain is swinging\n656:- `combo.cancel()`: stop the chain; the next press starts it over\n657:- `combo.current`: the Attack of the current hit\n658:- `combo.hits(targets, test, fn)`: the current hit's hits(targets, test, fn): fn(target) once per swing where test(target) is true\n659:- `combo.press()`: start or continue the chain. Returns true if a hit started\n660:- `combo.state`: what Humanoid.update wants as `attack` (null when idle)\n661:- `combo.update(dt)`: advance the current hit; returns the phase that began, as Attack.update\n662:- `combo.idle = 99`: seconds since the last hit ended\n663:- `combo.moves`: the Attacks\n664:- `combo.step = -1`: the index of the current hit (-1 before the first)\n665:- `combo.window`: seconds after a hit ends that a press still chains\n1019:- `new E.Bullets(game, o = {}) → shots`: new E.Bullets(game, { plane: 'ground' | 'side', max: 800, sparks: true }); game: its game\n1020:- `shots.burst(base, vels)`: fire several at once from a pattern list of [vx, v2] (v2 = vy on the ground plane, vz in side view)\n1021:- `shots.clear(team)`: remove every bullet, or only one team's\n1022:- `shots.draw(r)`: queue them for drawing (glowing cores, or their sprites)\n1023:- `shots.fire(b)`: fire one bullet. Fields: x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, r, dmg, life, team, color, core, sprite, pierce, grav, data\n1024:- `shots.hit(targets, fn, team)`: test bullets of `team` against targets (objects with x, y, z and r, or w/h in side view). fn(bullet, target). Returns hits\n1025:- `shots.update(dt, map)`: move them one step; with a map they stop at walls (a TileMap, or a PlatformMap in side views)\n1026:- `shots.list = []`: the live bullets\n1027:- `shots.max`: at most this many at once\n1028:- `shots.plane`: 'ground' (they fly over x and y) or 'side' (x and z)\n1029:- `shots.sparks`: a puff of sparks where one hits a wall","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181319__xb81546/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WtQDDekdE6MPuJro4ES3Hm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
