J44xMSa49ni2S\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The trace shows the cause: a scene change in the middle of a transition leaves the new scene running on the old run's state, and the attract tap is lost. Rather than patch the timing, I'll remove that transition from the attract loop. The demo will show its own result card and restart the shift in place, and only the human results screen will be a separate scene.\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":1714,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":180359,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":1714,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":6,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"4accd60f-1720-4154-a575-c0b8f1413e9f\",\"uuid\":\"169b7320-4040-4a3d-a2f3-749904d5a377\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-03T02:06:55.881Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011CgfBF5HmHCiqWqH1PUnhp\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011CgfBF5g5J44xMSa49ni2S\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_012rJw7hCBwDTmhVjZ1ikg8m\",\"name\":\"Bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"python3 -I - <<'EOF'\\np='src/game.js'\\ns=open(p).read()\\ndef rep(a,b):\\n    global s\\n    assert s.count(a)==1, a[:70]\\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"function finish(outcome) {\\n  if (st.outcome) return;\\n  st.outcome = outcome;\\n  if (!st.attract && LIVE && !st.reported) {\\\"\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"\\\"function finish(outcome) {\\n  if (st.outcome) return;\\n  st.outcome = outcome; st.endT = 0;\\n  if (st.attract) return;   // the demo shows its own card and starts the next shift in place\\n  if (LIVE && !st.reported) {\\\"\\\"\\\")\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"  game.audio.music(outcome === 'case' ? 'victory' : null);\\n  game.go('results');\\n}\\\"\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"\\\"  game.audio.music(outcome === 'case' ? 'victory' : null);\\n  game.go('results');\\n}\\n\\nfunction outcomeCard(r) {\\n  const m = Math.round(r.H / 2), o = st.outcome;\\n  r.overlay(g => E.font.title(g, HEADLINE[o] || 'OUT OF TIME', r.W / 2, m - 88, { scale: 3, align: 'center' }));\\n  const lines = [['PIECES BANKED', st.banked + ' of ' + NEED], ['HEAT', String(st.heat) + ' of ' + HEAT_MAX], ['SHIFT LEFT', remaining(st.elapsed) + ' s'], ['SCORE', String(score())]];\\n  lines.forEach(([k, v], i) => { r.text(k, r.W / 2 - 110, m - 40 + i * 14, '#d8cfe8', { shadow: '#000' }); r.text(v, r.W / 2 + 110, m - 40 + i * 14, '#ffd36a', { align: 'right', shadow: '#000' }); });\\n  E.font.wrap(QUOTE[o] || QUOTE.time, r.W - 60).forEach((l, i) => r.text(l, r.W / 2, m + 36 + i * 12, '#c8b890', { align: 'center', shadow: '#000' }));\\n}\\\"\\\"\\\")\\nrep(\\\"\\\"\\\"const results = {\\n  enter() { demoT = 0; },\\n  update(dt) {\\n    if (!st) return;\\n    if (st.attract) { demoT += dt; if (I().anyPressed() || demoT > 6) game.go(I().anyPressed() ? 'title' : 'demo'); return; }\\n    if (!LIVE && I().pressed('confirm')) game.go('title');\\n  },\\n  draw(r) {\\n    bg.draw(r);\\n    const m = Math.round(r.H / 2), o = st ? st.outcome : 'time';\\n    r.overlay(g => E.font.title(g, HEADLINE[o] || 'OUT OF TIME', r.W / 2, m - 88, { scale: 3, align: 'center' }));\\n    const lines = [['PIECES BANKED', st.banked + ' of ' + NEED], ['HEAT', String(st.heat) + ' of ' + HEAT_MAX], ['SHIFT LEFT', remaining(st.elapsed) + ' s'], ['SCORE', String(score())]];\\n    lines.forEach(([k, v], i) => { r.text(k, r.W / 2 - 110, m - 40 + i * 14, '#d8cfe8', { shadow: '#000' }); r.text(v, r.W / 2 + 110, m - 40 + i * 14, '#ffd36a', { align: 'right', shadow: '#000' }); });\\n    E.font.wrap(QUOTE[o] || QUOTE.time, r.W - 60).forEach((l, i) => r.text(l, r.W / 2, m + 36 + i * 12, '#c8b890', { align: 'cente